Third-party data
----------------

No corpus text is redistributed in this repository. The scripts fetch both
corpora from their upstream sources at run time.

TinyStories V2 (GPT-4)
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/roneneldan/TinyStories
  Community Data License Agreement, Sharing, version 1.0 (CDLA-Sharing-1.0)

FineWeb-Edu, sample-10BT
  https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceFW/fineweb-edu
  Open Data Commons Attribution License version 1.0 (ODC-By 1.0)

Derived artifact
----------------

data/tokenizer/tokenizer.json is a byte-level BPE vocabulary of 16,384 tokens
trained on a sample of the two corpora above, and is redistributed here because
reproducing any run requires the exact tokenizer. It is a derivative of those
datasets and carries their terms in addition to the MIT License that covers the
code: attribution to the two sources above under ODC-By 1.0, and the
share-alike terms of CDLA-Sharing-1.0 for any onward distribution of the file or
of data derived from it.
